    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <MinVerTagPrefix>Account.Abstractions/v</MinVerTagPrefix>
    <PackageId>TKWF.Ext.Account.Abstractions</PackageId>
    <Description>TKWF 扩展抽象：账户管理契约（IAccountPasswordManager 密码落地抽象）——依赖倒置（ADR48 D7），替代"扩展引扩展"耦合</Description>
